debscp (0.4.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Import sites from WinSCP configuration backup INI files.
  * Decode standard WinSCP saved passwords into the OS credential store.
  * Add automatic saved-password lookup across GUI, CLI, API and workspaces.
  * Preserve explicit and implicit FTPS modes and advanced session settings.
  * Handle WinSCP Unicode escaping, default settings and legacy encodings.

 -- DebSCP contributors <noreply@github.com>  Thu, 20 Aug 2026 20:00:00 +0100

debscp (0.3.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Validate partial-transfer identity before resuming downloads.
  * Fix synchronization conflicts, deletion ordering, and watch re-uploads.
  * Preserve advanced profiles and bind queued work to its originating tab.
  * Add SCP-only management fallback, recursive GUI operations, and API methods.
  * Harden WebDAV XML parsing and improve FTP/WebDAV compatibility.

 -- DebSCP contributors <noreply@github.com>  Thu, 20 Aug 2026 17:00:00 +0100

debscp (0.2.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Add complete multi-protocol and automation feature set.

